 @TheMacco26  At 16:50 they compare with DLSS and Raytracing, at least in a few games. And DLSS ist objectively better than FSR.
BUT I think DLSS will suffer the same fate as GSync did: It is too expensive, closed source and only limited to Nvidia RTX GPU's. That's because FSR can be added more easily - e.g. Unreal Engine only needs one checkbox checked for it to work.
Nvidia currently lists 154 DLSS games on their website, AMD only 88. Let's see who makes the race, but Nvidia definitely has a head start.

